{"retcode":0,"message":"OK","data":{"page":{"id":"501404","name":"无光鲸噬","desc":"无光鲸噬卡牌","icon_url":"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/06/04/258999284/6c8ce9408dc45b74242f45fb45c2e5d0_4468452485234515493.png","header_img_url":"","modules":[{"name":"基础信息","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"card_base_info","layout":"","data":"{\"moduleName\":\"基础信息\",\"layout_\":\"left\",\"name\":\"无光鲸噬\",\"common_img\":\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/06/04/258999284/6c8ce9408dc45b74242f45fb45c2e5d0_5201832840766640571.png\",\"gold_img\":\"\",\"life\":4,\"life_bg\":6,\"energy\":0,\"energy_bg\":0,\"attr\":[{\"key\":\"类型：\",\"value\":[\"装备牌\"]},{\"key\":\"标签：\",\"value\":[\"天赋\"]},{\"key\":\"获取：\",\"value\":[\"猫尾酒馆对战获取\"]},{\"key\":\"花费：\",\"value\":[\"4\"]}]}","style":""}],"id":"1","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"效果描述","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003chtml\u003e\u003chead\u003e\u003c/head\u003e\u003cbody\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e战斗行动\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\\\"详情\\\" data-name=\\\"\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026#34;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026#34;\u0026gt;战斗行动：\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026#34;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026#34;\u0026gt;我方执行了一次战斗行动后，会轮到对方行动。\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026#34;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026#34;\u0026gt;打出具有此规则的手牌是一个战斗行动，而非快速行动。\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\\\" class=\\\"wiki-note-text\\\"\u003e\u003csup class=\\\"wiki-sup\\\"\u003e[详情]\u003c/sup\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e：我方出战角色为\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e吞星之鲸\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e时，装备此牌。\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e吞星之鲸装备此牌后，立刻使用一次\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e迸落星雨\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\\\"详情\\\" data-name=\\\"\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;迸落星雨：\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026#34;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026#34;\u0026gt;元素战技\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026#34;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026#34;\u0026gt;造成1点\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026#34;color: rgb(24, 144, 255)\u0026#34;\u0026gt;水元素伤害\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026#34;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026#34;\u0026gt;，此角色每有3点\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026#34;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026#34;\u0026gt;无尽食欲\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026#34;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026#34;\u0026gt;提供的额外最大生命，此伤害+1（最多+4）。然后\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026#34;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026#34;\u0026gt;舍弃\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026#34;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026#34;\u0026gt;1张原本元素骰费用最高的手牌。\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\\\" class=\\\"wiki-note-text\\\"\u003e\u003csup class=\\\"wiki-sup\\\"\u003e[详情]\u003c/sup\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e。\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e装备有此牌的吞星之鲸使用\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e迸落星雨\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\\\"详情\\\" data-name=\\\"\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;迸落星雨：\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026#34;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026#34;\u0026gt;元素战技\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026#34;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026#34;\u0026gt;造成1点\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026#34;color: rgb(24, 144, 255)\u0026#34;\u0026gt;水元素伤害\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026#34;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026#34;\u0026gt;，此角色每有3点\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026#34;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026#34;\u0026gt;无尽食欲\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026#34;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026#34;\u0026gt;提供的额外最大生命，此伤害+1（最多+4）。然后\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026#34;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026#34;\u0026gt;舍弃\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026#34;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026#34;\u0026gt;1张原本元素骰费用最高的手牌。\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\\\" class=\\\"wiki-note-text\\\"\u003e\u003csup class=\\\"wiki-sup\\\"\u003e[详情]\u003c/sup\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e舍弃\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\\\"详情\\\" data-name=\\\"\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026#34;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026#34;\u0026gt;舍弃：\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;通过行动牌或角色技能的效果，将行动牌从手牌或牌库中弃置。\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\\\" class=\\\"wiki-note-text\\\"\u003e\u003csup class=\\\"wiki-sup\\\"\u003e[详情]\u003c/sup\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e1张手牌后：治疗此角色，其数值等同于所\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e舍弃\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\\\"详情\\\" data-name=\\\"\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026#34;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026#34;\u0026gt;舍弃：\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;通过行动牌或角色技能的效果，将行动牌从手牌或牌库中弃置。\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\\\" class=\\\"wiki-note-text\\\"\u003e\u003csup class=\\\"wiki-sup\\\"\u003e[详情]\u003c/sup\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e手牌的当前元素骰费用。（每回合1次）\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e（牌组中包含吞星之鲸，才能加入牌组）\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/body\u003e\u003c/html\u003e\",\"switch\":true,\"is_show_switch\":true,\"without_border\":false}\n","style":""}],"id":"2","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":true,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"卡牌故事","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e吞星之鲸·无光鲸噬\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e梦中无月的漆黑海面上，尽是闪着磷光的浮游生物——或许正如某种巨兽的食粮。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"switch\":true,\"is_show_switch\":true,\"without_border\":false}\n","style":""}],"id":"3","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":true,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false}],"filter_values":{},"menu_id":"0","menu_name":"","version":"1775974894","langs":[],"template_layout":{"tab":[{"tab_id":"1","tab_name":"页签1","module_group":[{"module_group_id":"1","layout":"l1r1","module":[{"id":"1","pos":"left"},{"id":"2","pos":"right"},{"i